# Chapter V, the Kanzler's end: Calisto tells the player who they are and
# sends them to kill the Kanzler; soldiers ambush the mountain path, a hooded
# figure hands over the river-gate key, the player crosses the shut city and
# kills Brutus in Stormwend Tower. Nothing in the data writes stage 7.
# Position stands in for the walks, and damage for the duel; ref FormIDs
# carry Arktwend's slot 05.
# Run: python -m tools.live.test_instance mwtest --cases <this folder> --fast --checkpoints --stop-on-fail --from mord_calisto
# See docs/commentary/headless_testing.md#quest-runs

# Calisto's mountain hideout, where the dragon set the player down.
case mord_calisto
run
player->Position -24902 22420 3837 180
until 600 MenuMode == 1
wait 60
ask tell me everything
choose 1
choose 2
choose 3
choose 4
bye
expect GetJournalIndex A_V_KanzlerMord == 1
end

# The Kanzler's soldiers wait on the mountain path.
case mord_ambush
run
player->Position -25218 19600 3955 0
until 300 GetJournalIndex A_V_KanzlerMord == 2
end

# Outside the shut city, a hooded figure knows the way in by the river.
case mord_hooded
run
player->Position -1463 31300 624 0
until 300 MenuMode == 1
wait 60
bye
expect GetJournalIndex A_V_KanzlerMord == 3
expect player->GetItemCount Key_StormwendFluss == 1
end

# Through the city, past the guards, the market and the tower gate.
case mord_city
run
player->Position 4572 38435 -11 0
until 300 GetJournalIndex A_V_KanzlerMord == 4
run
player->Position 287 52258 223 0
until 300 GetJournalIndex A_V_KanzlerMord == 5
run
player->Position -8675 54404 234 0
until 300 GetJournalIndex A_V_KanzlerMord == 6
end

# The throne room: Brutus calls the player out, and falls.
case mord_kanzler
run
player->PositionCell 3217 3700 12130 0 "Stormwend Tower"
until 600 Stormwendvar == 24
until 300 MenuMode == 1
wait 60
bye
console 056E8150.damageav health 100000
until 900 GetJournalIndex A_V_KanzlerMord == 8
expect Stormwendvar == 25
end
